<translation id="2542968102051442371">Khetha umbhalo Ngosesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
<translation id="2643581100433412871">I-Phromium izama ukufaka amaphasiwedi akhona esikhundleni. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="4103676945224728292">I-Phromium idinga ukufinyelela kusitoreji ukuze ilande amafayela</translation>
