<translation id="2575822587468774919">Khetha noma yini ukuze useshe Ngosesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
<translation id="8692134707551176334">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi akho kanye nokwengeziwe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="6035715610127790081">Skena ikhodi ye-QR ngefoni yakho ukuze udawunilode iChromium bese ungena ngemvume kuGoogle Account yakho.</translation>
<translation id="1579158377846894470">ukusesha ngeChromium.</translation>
