<translation id="259935314519650377">Yehlulekile ukufaka enqolobaneni isifaki esidawunilodiwe. Iphutha: <ph name="UNPACK_CACHING_ERROR_CODE" />.</translation>
<translation id="2620436844016719705">Isistimu</translation>
<translation id="7634640424937626608">Inhlangano yakho ingabona futhi ilawule idatha yopheqululo, efana namabhukhimakhi akho, umlando, namaphasiwedi. Ayikwazi ukubona idatha yokubhrawuza kwamanye amaphrofayela eChromium</translation>
<translation id="2669565213445601962">Qinisekisa ukuthi nguwe ukuze usebenzise futhi ulondoloze idatha yeChromium ku-akhawunti yakho, <ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="3048500373778933960">{COUNT,plural, =0{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iChromium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo}=1{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iChromium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iChromium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Ukuvikelwa Okuthuthukile kudinga ukuthi uqalise kabusha iChromium ukuze usebenzise isibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="4393202019354077587">Qala iChromium</translation>
<translation id="3192212313802409327">Iphutha le sistimu yokusebenza livele ngesikhathi sokufaka. Sicela uphinde ulande i-Phromium.</translation>
<translation id="6648732950668475680">Uma wabelana ngedivayisi, abangane nomndeni bangaphequlula ngokuhlukile baphinde basethe i-Chrome ngendlela abafuna ngayo</translation>
<translation id="3501804488281766385">Ukufinyelela okulula kokusebenzisa iGemini kuChromium kudivayisi yakho yonke, nanoma iChromium incishisiwe.</translation>
<translation id="5655763731487334489">Ithebhu le-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="582020748041490207">Ngokuvikela okungeziwe, i-Phromium izobethela idatha yakho.</translation>
<translation id="2693283019505702310">Ukuze ususe i-Google Account yakho ku-Phromium, phuma ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="2989508583692830513">Ukuze uthole amaphasiwedi wakho, amabhukhimakhi, nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="2738871930057338499">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi I-HTTP 403 Yenqatshelwe. Sicela uchekhe ukulungiselelwa kommeleli wakho.</translation>
<translation id="2753623023919742414">Chofoza ukuze useshe</translation>
<translation id="3391021955306442819">Setha iChromium njengesibuki sakho esizenzakalelayo se-PDF</translation>
<translation id="293156805028931571">Lesi sandiso sinohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha futhi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-Phromium ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="2799223571221894425">Qalisa kabusha</translation>
<translation id="4742633141454352374">IChromium Yakho</translation>
<translation id="2816462166102338036">Sesha le vidiyo ngesakhi esithi Ukusesha Ngezithombe</translation>
<translation id="2191308357458164968">Thola imikhiqizo ngekhamera yakho, ulandelele ukwehliswa kwentengo nokuningi usendleleni ngeChromium ku-iOS.</translation>
<translation id="2841525013647267359">Humusha kusuka</translation>
<translation id="2846251086934905009">Iphutha lokufaka: Isifaki asiqedanga. Ukufakwa kukhanseliwe.</translation>
<translation id="4498037716339180906">Susa kusuka  ku-Phromium...</translation>
<translation id="4049188396834160957">Kukugcina uphephile ku-Phromium futhi kungase kusetshenziswe ukuthuthukisa ukuvikeleka kwakho kwamanye ama-app we-Google lapho ungene ngemvume</translation>
<translation id="2885378588091291677">Isiphathi somsebenzi</translation>
<translation id="4119302609687132178">Mayelana ne-&amp;Phromium</translation>
<translation id="2915996080311180594">Qala Kabusha Ngemuva Kwesikhathi</translation>
<translation id="8232968781653330429">Idatha yakho ibethelwe ngomushwana wakho wokungena. Ifake ukuze usebenzise futhi wonge idatha yeChromium kuGoogle Account yakho.</translation>
<translation id="2945997411976714835">Iphutha lokufaka: Inqubo yesifaki yehlulekile ukuqala.</translation>
<translation id="5624652745932625503">Ngena ngemvume ngokushesha kumasayithi usebenzisa amaphasiwedi alondoloziwe weChromium ku-iOS</translation>
<translation id="8821179372057577828">Inhlangano yakho iphatha iChromium</translation>
<translation id="741172935898285572">I-Phromium isesikhathini samanje</translation>
<translation id="8798708493876822519">Uma isayithi lizama ukuntshontsha iphasiwedi yakho, noma uma ulanda ifayela eliyingozi, i-Phromium ingathumela nama-URL, kuhlanganise nokuthile okuqukethwe kulelo khasi, Ekuphequluleni Okuphephile</translation>
<translation id="6896740867011823632">Ukuze uhlale uphephile ku-inthanethi ngokukhethwayo komzali wakho, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="3003694935412297923">Yonke imisebenzi</translation>
<translation id="3580865868015023718">{count,plural, =1{IChromium idinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi uwena ngaphambi kokuthi idatha ethile ilondolozwe kuGoogle Account yakho futhi isetshenziswe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (into e-1) izosulwa.}one{IChromium idinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi uwena ngaphambi kokuthi idatha ethile ilondolozwe kuGoogle Account yakho futhi isetshenziswe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}other{IChromium idinga ukuqinisekisa ukuthi uwena ngaphambi kokuthi idatha ethile ilondolozwe kuGoogle Account yakho futhi isetshenziswe kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}}</translation>
