<translation id="919456815618829047">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuChromium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzophinde uthole uhlu lwakho lokufunda nokuningi ku-<ph name="DEVICE" />.</translation>
<translation id="6141754610526066487">Amanye amaphrofayela e-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="2380720899384114679">Izandiso ziyizengezo ezikuvumela ukuthi uqambe ngokwabahlinzekelwayo iChromium. Ukusuka ekuhlaleni uhlelekile, ukuya ekwenzeni lula imisebenzi yansuku zonke, izandiso zikusiza wenze iChromium ibe ngeyakho.</translation>
<translation id="2507281899032275020">Siza ukwenza i-Phromium ibe ngcono ngokuthumela imibiko yokuphahlazeka ne-<ph name="UMA_LINK" /> ku-Google</translation>
<translation id="1514966729948178660">Sebenzisa i-app yeChromium ukuze uvikele iGoogle usendleleni</translation>
<translation id="4158795507995981959">{NUM_DEVICES,plural, =0{Idivayisi e-1 ye-USB ibifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Phromium esisodwa noma eziningi}=1{Idivayisi e-1 ye-USB ifinyelelwa yisandiso se-Phromium esisodwa noma eziningi}one{Amadivayisi angu-# e-USB abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Phromium esisodwa noma eziningi}other{Amadivayisi angu-# e-USB abefinyelelwa yisandiso se-Phromium esisodwa noma eziningi}}</translation>
<translation id="78720743239019396">Ukuze uthole uhlu lwakho lokufunda nokuningi ku-<ph name="DEVICE" />, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="7000206277447032115">Umlando weChromium</translation>
<translation id="4555002192651219296">Isifaki sihlulekile ukungaminyanisi ingobo yomlando. Sicela ulande i-Phromium futhi.</translation>
<translation id="310459126943037700">Yehlulekile ukuqeda imisebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="3104828284009500087">Sesha noma yini ekhasini</translation>
<translation id="4867557516756736957">Gcina amaphasiwedi akho, amabhukhimakhi, nomlando kuvunyelaniswe ngokuphelele kuwo wonke amadivayisi. Finyelela kalula izakhi ozaziyo nozithandayo ngokubuyekeza ibhrawuza yakho evuleka ngokuzenzakalelayo ibe yiChromium.</translation>
<translation id="8632308594821621017">I-Phromium isebenzisa imakrofoni yakho.</translation>
<translation id="3130333203120345554">Usesho olusha</translation>
<translation id="3137969841538672700">Hudulela oseshweni</translation>
<translation id="9173792796158381383">Le thebhu isebenzisa izinsiza ezengeziwe. Ukuze uthuthukise ukusebenza kwakho, vumela iChromium ikwenze kungasebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="8874679893080632357">Ukuze wabelane ngesikrini sakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kweChromium Kumasethingi Ohlelo</translation>
<translation id="101045618220347251">Phinda uqalise i-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="3161522574479303604">Zonke izilimi</translation>
<translation id="5940989267583033306">Vula isixhumanisi kuwindi le-Phromium Inco&amp;gnito</translation>
<translation id="2045477525210426976">Yenza ngendlela oyifisayo iphrofayela yakho entsha ye-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="3540518135502114323">Ungaqhubeka nokuxoxa Ngemodi ye-AI ngaphandle kokushintsha amathebhu. Ukuze uqalise, ngena ngemvume kuChromium. Uzophinde uthole namaphasiwedi akho nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho.</translation>
<translation id="1496180326063744749">Ukuze ususe i-Google Account yakho ku-Phromium, phuma ngemvume ku-Phromium ekhasini Lamasethingi</translation>
<translation id="7792783034323745412">Emva kwesikhathi, iChromium ingakucela ukuthi usebenzise ulwazi olulondoloziwe ukuze uzigcwalisele amafomu</translation>
<translation id="5240091371721695404">I-Phromium ayikwazi ukufunda nokubhala umkhombandlela wayo wedatha:

<ph name="USER_DATA_DIRECTORY" /></translation>
<translation id="2746489948338052955">Sebenzisa amathuluzi akho ayintandokazi eGoogle AI usendleleni ngeChromium ku-iOS.</translation>
<translation id="4848363951707149242">Ukuze uthole izandiso zakho nokukuma<ph name="DEVICE" />, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="3286538390144397061">Qala kabusha manje</translation>
<translation id="8613877111531019527">Okhiye be-Google API abekho. Okunye ukusebenza kwe-Phromium kuzokhutshazwa.</translation>
<translation id="2784090498377460662">Qhubeka usebenzise izinhlelo zokusebenza ezingemuva uma i-Phromium ivaliwe</translation>
<translation id="3905054486991167751">IChromium izobuyekeza uma ungekho</translation>
<translation id="4502950976754616266">I-Phromium izokuxwayisa ngaphambi kokulayisha noma iyiphi isayithi isebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile</translation>
<translation id="6107453188231652861">Uzophuma ngemvume emasayithini amaningi uma uvala wonke amawindi e-Phromium, ngaphandle kwe-Google Account yakho uma ungene ngemvume ku-Phromium. Ukuvumela amasayithi akukhumbule, <ph name="SETTINGS_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="3352986031709923790">ikhona elingaphezulu ngakwesokudla lendawo yokusesha: ngakwesokudla okungu-<ph name="RIGHT" />%, phezulu okungu-<ph name="TOP" />%</translation>
<translation id="5896635343289575401">Idatha ye-Phromium ku-akhawunti yakho</translation>
<translation id="5662253013097242821">Sebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho ngeChromium efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="3387527074123400161">I-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="5326080492429181135">Shintshela kwiphrofayela le-Phromium elikhona kakade?</translation>
<translation id="3412460710772753638">Kokuthi Isiphathi Sephasiwedi kule divayisi</translation>
<translation id="657700335789940813">IChromium ifuna ukubuyekeza</translation>
<translation id="3487742274367151379">Ukuze uthole amabhukhimakhi akho nokukuma<ph name="DEVICE" />, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="3438772217992559640">Sesha Le Thebhu Ngosesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
<translation id="8062355070850891600">Nweba Ukubhrawuza Okuphephe Ngokuthuthukisiwe ngeChromium efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="5419337472918920970">Yenza iChromium ibe ngeyakho...</translation>
<translation id="6573105037542661278">Lokhu kuzobuyekeza izinto ezingu-<ph name="ITEMS_COUNT" /> kusuka kule divayisi. Ukuze ubuyise idatha yakho, ngena ngemvume ku-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" /> njengo.</translation>
<translation id="4600986251755456192">I-<ph name="SHORTCUT" /> ingashintsha phakathi kwamaphrofayela we-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="8118189978246431067">Sicela uvale wonke amawindi we-Phromium uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7430418346833889620">Ukuze wabelane ngewindi lakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kweChromium Kumasethingi Ohlelo.</translation>
<translation id="2943929290955142701">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usevele ungene ngemvume.  Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume ku-Phromium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /></translation>
