<translation id="354621070532799440">Isikhumbuzi: Izakhi zokuphepha ezihamba phambili zeGoogle ephaketheni lakho</translation>
<translation id="6718500626359284607">Ukuze wabelane ngesikrini sakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kweChromium Kumasethingi Ohlelo.</translation>
