<translation id="8702816719621016911">Idatha yokuphequlula yalo muntu izosuswa kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uthole idatha, ngena ngemvume ku-Phromium njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="64780623876080332">{COUNT,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Phromium siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha.}=1{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Phromium siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Phromium siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Phromium siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="3667616615096815454">Ayikwazi ukufaka, uhlelo lokusebenza alwaziwa kuseva.</translation>
<translation id="678730369472836428">Sebenzisa <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />umushwana wokungena <ph name="END_LINK" />ukuze ubhale ngokubethela idatha yeChrome kuGoogle Account yakho. Izindlela zokukhokha namakheli kusuka kuGoogle Pay ngeke kubethelwe. Umlando wokubhrawuza ovela kuChromium ngeke uvumelanise.</translation>
<translation id="2393631353645378988">{COUNT,plural, =0{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Phromium ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo}=1{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Phromium ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Phromium ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Phromium ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="2203303261468330007">Vula isixhumanisi ku&amp;thebhu elisha le-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="686463893976008238">Linka i-Phromium namanye amasevisi e-Google ngokwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye nangezinye izinjongo</translation>
<translation id="3729187154190517324">Julisa usesho lwakho ngokufaka amathebhu amaningi, amafayela, namathuluzi usebenzisa inkinobho ethi "Faka ithebhu nokuningi".</translation>
<translation id="5596264049590907430">Phatha Amaphrofayela e-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="5594723037153142396">Funda ukuthi kungani i-Phromium ivimbela ukudawuniloda okuthile</translation>
<translation id="3425307214497790458">I-Phromium izokwazisa uma kukhona okudinga isibuyekezo sakho</translation>
<translation id="4247980944121268675">I-Phromium ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi okungenzeka uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="3810973564298564668">Phatha</translation>
<translation id="1058395779823101457">Ukuze usebenzise amaphasiwedi akho agciniwe, landela ikhodi ye-QR, dawuniloda iChromium ye-iOS bese ungena ngemvume kuGoogle Account yakho</translation>
<translation id="3846683726093018685">**Fingqa:** Ngomusho owodwa onamagama angaphansi kwa-30, chaza abantu ebhekiswe kubo nenjongo eyinhloko yekhontenti yakho eku-screenshot.

          **Phakamisa Imibuzo:** Sungula uhlu lwamachashazi olunemibuzo emi-3 ukuya kwemi-5 eshukumisa ingqondo engase ibuzwe umsebenzisi ukuze asiqonde kahle i-screenshot. Le mibuzo kufanele ihlanganise okungenani owodwa okhuluma ngokuqondile ngento ebukwayo, indlela eklanywe ngayo, noma indawo ekuyo.</translation>
<translation id="1339028735921640597"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Phromium</translation>
<translation id="430953676539987275">Ukuze uthole amabhukhimakhi nokukumadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="3885770153807205175">Okokukhetha ulimi</translation>
<translation id="5947409614720749543">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-Phromium. Okuthile kudinga ukuthi ukunake - chofoza ngemininingwane.</translation>
<translation id="2176348074240183776">Chofoza igama lakho ukuze uvule i-Phromium uphinde uqale ukudlulisa amehlo.</translation>
<translation id="3892148308691398805">Kopisha umbhalo</translation>
<translation id="3679766722656346339">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengene ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-Phromium. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-Phromium ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6085953975934135790">Lesi sandiso sephula inqubomgomo Yesitolo sewebu se-Chrome, futhi kungenzeka singabi esiphephile. Sisuse ku-Phromium ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="3941890832296813527">Iphutha lokufaka: Igama lefayela lesifaki alivumelekile noma alisekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="608187946760434925">I-Phromium izama ukukopisha amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="3054592240125889472">Ukuze uthole imininingwane oyigcinile nokukumadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="3140795250676341027">Amaphasiwedi akho, izindlela zokukhokha, namakheli owalondoloze kuGoogle Account yakho azosuswa kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uzisebenzise kuChromium, ngena ngemvume futhi.</translation>
<translation id="395904275706073188">Amakhasi avikelwe awakwazi ukufundwa. Zama ikhasi elehlukile.</translation>
<translation id="4227910144250222665">Funda ukuthi i-Phromium ikugcina kanjani uphephile</translation>
<translation id="3967822245660637423">Ukulanda kuqedile</translation>
<translation id="4150430234581811723">Uma uthayipha kubha yekheli noma ebhokisini lokusesha, iChromium ithumela okuthayiphayo kusesho lwenhlangano yakho, i-AI, nakumathuluzi omenzeli ukuthola iziphakamiso.</translation>
<translation id="3975724895399328945">Mayelana ne-&amp;Google Chrome Yokuhlola</translation>
<translation id="3997429360543082038">Mayelana ne-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="4847805566397342820">Lapho uvakashela isayithi, iChromium ithumela ingxenye eyi-obfuscation ye-URL kokuthi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Ukubhrawuza ngokuphephile kweGoogle<ph name="END_LINK" /> isebenzisa iseva yangasese efihla ikheli lakho lasesizindeni se-inthanethi. Uma isayithi ingakusekeli okuthile okusolisayo, kuzothunyelwa wonke ama-URL kanye nekhontenti encane yekhasi.</translation>
<translation id="4016217212818346953">Hlala uphephile Ngesiphathi Sephasiwedi</translation>
<translation id="4019629340646866719">I-ChromiumOS yenziwe ukuthi isebenze ngesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile owengeziwe<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />, njengoba kunjalo ngendawo yokuthuthukiswa kwe-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />Linux<ph name="END_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />.</translation>
<translation id="4022972681110646219">Isikrini sokuhumusha</translation>
<translation id="4023601594785368013">Ulimi loqobo: <ph name="LANGUAGE" /></translation>
<translation id="7037690020492895588">Vula amalinki kuChromium kunoma iyiphi i-app. Futhi ukuze ifinyeleleke kalula, iphinwa ku-taskbar yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6916567874038032700">Siza i-Phromium ibengcono ngokubika <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />izilungiselelo zamanje<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="4050175100176540509">Ukuthuthukiswa kokuphepha okubalulekile nezici ezintsha kuyathokala kunguqulo yakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="4055805654398742145">Umphathi Wephasiwedi</translation>
<translation id="4327384240042572707">{COUNT,plural, =1{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Phromium ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga umzuzu o-1. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.}one{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Phromium ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga imizuzu engu-#. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.}other{Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Phromium ngokuzenzekelayo uma ingasetshenziswanga imizuzu engu-#. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.}}</translation>
<translation id="2498876341137940584">I-Phromium Incognito</translation>
<translation id="1371775705240141332">Iya ekhasini elithi Mayelana neChromium</translation>
<translation id="1983555117242858621">Qamba ngokwabahlinzekelwayo iChrome ukuze unikeze ibhrawuza yakho ukubukeka okusha</translation>
<translation id="3730928612696305544">Qamba ngokwabahlinzekelwayo iChromium yakho</translation>
<translation id="4148957013307229264">Iyafaka...</translation>
<translation id="5030279289462254554"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Inethiwekhi Yokungena ngemvume - i-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="8940475598678719246">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuChromium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzophinde uthole uhlu lwakho lokufunda nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho.</translation>
<translation id="3361801572720154185">Thola izinhlelo zokusebenza ezinhle, amageyimu, izandiso, namatimu we-Phromium.</translation>
<translation id="5104340040322658377">Ukuze uthole lesi sandiso nokuningi kuwo wonke amakhompyutha wakho, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="6533832886058295845">Ukuze uhlale uphephile ku-inthanethi ngokukhetha komzali wakho, shintshela kuphrofayela yakho yeChromium lapho usungene ngemvume kakade njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /></translation>
<translation id="4222932583846282852">Iyakhansela...</translation>
<translation id="4224210481850767180">Ukufaka kukhanseliwe.</translation>
<translation id="6904238369362879351">Xhumanisa idatha yakho ye-Phromium kule akhawunti?</translation>
<translation id="357744319784654404">Ikuxwayisa mayelana namasayithi ayingozi, ngisho nalawo i-Google ebingazi ngawo ngaphambili, ngokuhlaziya idatha eningi evela kumasayithi kunokuvikela okujwayelekile. Ungakhetha ukweqa izixwayiso ze-Phromium.</translation>
<translation id="7228779501660520489">Phuma Ngemvume ku-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="2782053121162821">Thola usizo nge-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="4281844954008187215">Imigomo yesevisi</translation>
<translation id="5084022108026911204">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha elingacacisiwe. Uma ngabe i-Phromium iyasebenza manje, sicela uyivale uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="5139026954638666406">Khipha amaphasiwedi Ukusuka kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="4304713468139749426">Isiphathi sephasiwedi</translation>
<translation id="4334241893986177674">Sesha lesi sithombe-skrini</translation>
<translation id="8324735155671556570">Qalisa iChromium lapho iWindows iqala</translation>
<translation id="4400772909124543403">Asikho isibuyekezo esitholakalayo</translation>
<translation id="2185735215611818026">Phuma ku-Phromium noma kunjalo?</translation>
<translation id="4413205837991854510">Bonisa Isinqamuleli Sokusesha Umfanekiso Njalo</translation>
<translation id="1338297030721125711">Vumela i-Phromium isebenze ngemuva</translation>
<translation id="3764462296589283740">{NUM_EXTENSIONS,plural, =1{IChromium incoma ukuthi usisuse. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana nezandiso ezisekelwayo<ph name="END_LINK" />}one{IChromium incoma ukuthi uzisuse. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana nezandiso ezisekelwayo<ph name="END_LINK" />}other{IChromium incoma ukuthi uzisuse. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana nezandiso ezisekelwayo<ph name="END_LINK" />}}</translation>
<translation id="1011403527148313450">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="4427306783828095590">Isivikelo esithuthukisiwe senza okuningi ukuvimba ubugebengu bokweba imininingwane ebucayi kanye uhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="4434353761996769206">Iphutha lesifaki: <ph name="INSTALLER_ERROR" /></translation>
<translation id="5736318769022575415">U-<ph name="MANAGER" /> uphatha iChromium</translation>
<translation id="2477616462388290618">Faka iphrofayela yeChromium</translation>
<translation id="4447409407328223819">Mayelana ne-Chrome Yokuhlola</translation>
<translation id="972523218852576493">Ukuze usebenzise futhi ulondoloze idatha yeChromium kuGoogle Account yakho, faka umushwana wakho wokungena</translation>
<translation id="4493028449971051158">Iphutha ekuqaliseni: sicela usebenzise isifaki njengomlawuli.</translation>
<translation id="4501471624619070934">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngoba ukufinyelela kukhawulelwe kuleli zwe.</translation>
<translation id="8839763675940122379">Lesi sandiso asikashicileli izindlela zangasese zokuziphatha, njengokuthi siyiqoqa futhi siyisebenzise kanjani idatha. I-Phromium incoma ukuthi usisuse.</translation>
<translation id="2339640488105852505">Siyakwamukela ku-Phromium; iwindi elisha lesiphequluli livuliwe</translation>
<translation id="8536959233160434213">I-Phromium idinga imvume yokumepha indawo ekuzungezile futhi ilandelele izandla zakho</translation>
<translation id="1077734277628859167">Usuvele ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> kwenye iphrofayela ye-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="5512897665247593318">IChromium ilayisha ngaphambilini amakhasi okwenza ukubhrawuza nokusesha kusheshe. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana namakhasi okulayisha kuqala<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="4549180975214802957">Uthuthukisa ukuphepha ku-inthanethi kwawo wonke umuntu uma ubika isayithi ocabanga ukuthi liyingozi.</translation>
<translation id="6624033199018630177">I-Phromium ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba uvale Ukuphequlula Okuphephile futhi ifayela alikwazi ukuqinisekiswa</translation>
<translation id="3039804643080655517">Zama iGoogle Lens ngeChromium efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="4594305310729380060">Kusiphathi Sephasiwedi kule divayisi</translation>
<translation id="8064263528617889755">Izinhlelo zokusebenza ze-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="4598116752460667024">Sesha noma iyiphi inqubo ohlwini.</translation>
<translation id="4613863813562375431">Uhlobo lwe-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="7245201002247176127">Icishe isesikhathini! Qalisa kabusha i-Phromium ukuze uqedele ukubuyekeza.</translation>
<translation id="8846891938874485868">Isheshisa amasayithi anenjini yeChromium V8 kodwa yenza iChromium ingabi namandla okumelana nokuhlaselwa.</translation>
<translation id="7525500996671436081">Vula iSearch ngeChromium</translation>
<translation id="1224842000407297331">Iphrofayela yeChromium</translation>
<translation id="4956303519269880412">Isexwayiso: I-Phromium ayikwazi ukuvimbela izandiso kusuka ekurekhodeni umlando wakho wokudlulisa amehlo. Ukuze ukhubaze lesi sandiso kumodi ye-incognito, yekisa ukukhetha le nketho.</translation>
<translation id="2708255035805733225">Uma futhi wabelana ngemibiko yokusetshenziswa kwe-Phromium, leyo mibiko ihlanganisa nama-URL owavakashelayo</translation>
<translation id="4673710618874938871">Ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="USER_NAME" />, ubulungu. Vula imenyu ye-akhawunti</translation>
<translation id="1883292567514549610">Iphrofayela ibukeka isetshenziswa enye inqubo ye-Phromium (<ph name="PROCESS_ID" />) kwenye ikhompyutha (<ph name="HOST_NAME" />). I-Phromium ikhiye iphrofayela ukuze ingamosheki. Uma uqinisekile ukuthi azikho ezinye izinqubo ezisebenzisa le phrofayela, ungavula iphrofayela uphinde uqalise i-Phromium.</translation>
<translation id="4680828127924988555">Khansela Ukufaka</translation>
<translation id="1889305042180577023">Enye idatha yakho yeChromium ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="8079525505870459051">Ngenkathi ungene ngemvume, ungasebenzisa amaphasiwedi akho nokuningi ukusuka kuGoogle Account yakho kuChromium. I-<ph name="SHORTCUT" /> ingashintsha amasethingi wakho wamasevisi eGoogle.</translation>
<translation id="2171507067211697961">Umuntu othile ungene ngemvume ngaphambilini ku-Phromium kule khompuyutha njengo-<ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL_LAST" />. Sicela udale umsebenzisi omusha we-Phromium ukuze ugcine ulwazi lwakho luhlukile.</translation>
<translation id="4724676981607797757">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha lephrothokholi engasekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="6925701206088903005">Phuma ku-Phromium noma kunjalo?</translation>
<translation id="4514755609496543621">Isibuyekezo esibalulekile sokuvikela se-Phromium sisanda kufakwa. Qalisa kabusha manje bese sizobuyisela amathebhu akho.</translation>
<translation id="8673673368917636496">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IChromium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" />, nokunye okungu-<ph name="COUNT" /> okwengeziwe</translation>
<translation id="3638319732826965647">Uma iGemini kuChromium ivuliwe, iphaneli eseceleni ihlala ivuliwe uma usungula amathebhu amasha</translation>
<translation id="479167709087336770">Lokhu kusebenzisa isihloli sokupeleta esifanayo naleso esisetshenziswe kusesho lwe-Google. Umbhalo owuthayiphayo kusiphequluli uthunyelwa ku-Google. Ungahlala ushintsha le mpatho kuzilungiselelo.</translation>
<translation id="2659245507243672392">Sebenzisa i-Phromium ngaphandle kwe-akhawunti</translation>
<translation id="166411027652942990">Umyalo obambeke ngaphakathi we-Phromium wokuvumela ithrafikhi ye-mDNS.</translation>
<translation id="6031862420354068813">Qalisa kabusha ukuze Ubuyekeze i-&amp;Phromium</translation>
<translation id="4918086044614829423">Yamukela</translation>
<translation id="4918844574251943176">Umfanekiso ukopishiwe</translation>
<translation id="1531905832227009774">Ukuze uthole uhlu lwakho lokufunda nokukumadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="4319892378006430019">I-Phromium kumodi yasemuva.</translation>
<translation id="8972359100025490790">Chofoza ukuze uvale ibhokisi lokungena ngemvume leChromium</translation>
<translation id="3639078149590125530">Ngamaphrofayela weChromium ungahlukanisa zonke izinto zakho zeChromium. Sungula amaphrofayela wabangane nomndeni, noma uhlukanise phakathi komsebenzi nobumnandi.</translation>
<translation id="7141327976224964788">Izihambeli zingasebenzisa i-Phromium ngaphandle kokushiya noma yini ngemuva.</translation>
<translation id="7007327521155149139">I-akhawunti Yakho kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="5973804420920585431">Zingeze ngokwakho ku-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="504699503110800016">Vula imenyu yakho konke</translation>
<translation id="2497925691306722252">Finyelela zonke izintandokazi zakho zeGoogle ngeChromium ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho</translation>
<translation id="8678196879882043620">IChromium idinga imvume ukuze ilandelele izandla zakho</translation>
<translation id="3397880081430454820">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IChromium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_3" />.</translation>
<translation id="9114243566897924763">Ngena ngemvume ku-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="5174969993834422967">Uvamise ukuvimba izaziso. Ukuze uvumele leli sayithi ukuthi likwazise, chofoza isithonjana sesaziso ekhoneni elingakwesokudla lebha yendawo yakho.</translation>
<translation id="5174983315706567306">Asikho isikhala sediski esanele.</translation>
<translation id="7698884672439844280">I-akhawunti yeChromium idinga ukuqinisekiswa kabusha</translation>
<translation id="5629965056131882780">Qhubeka lapho ugcine khona ngeChromium ku-iOS.</translation>
<translation id="874294566462998787">Phuma ngemvume ku-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="5234764350956374838">Cashisa</translation>
<translation id="8605581794204249702">Vula ilinki kuwindi leChromium Inco&amp;gnito</translation>
<translation id="8722804301463582643">Thola i-app yeChromium ukuze ulondoloze amaphasiwedi usendleleni</translation>
<translation id="6253936671561887082">Ukuze ufake izinguquko zakho, qalisa kabusha i-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="7405713141437293142">Ukuze uthumele le thebhu kwenye idivayisi, ngena ngemvume kuChromium kuwo womabili amadivayisi</translation>
<translation id="5286907366254680517">Okutholiwe</translation>
<translation id="2224284460884535818">Thola i-app yeChromium</translation>
<translation id="1426207087952749578">Uma ubhrawuza ngemodi ye-Incognito, i-Phromium izokuxwayisa ngaphambi kokulayisha isayithi isebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile.</translation>
<translation id="8108751453879231987">Sesha ngeChromium</translation>
<translation id="7780358745459835678">Isevisi Yangaphakathi Yesibuyekezi SeChromium</translation>
<translation id="6956753580765202069">Zisebenzise kanye nezinye izakhi zeGemini kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="5346389065299425353">Julisa usesho lwakho ngokufaka amathebhu amaningi, amafayela, namathuluzi</translation>
<translation id="8684266995248242891">Thola amazwibela asheshayo ale dokhumenti bese ubuza imibuzo ngeGemini kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="586104673506947714">I-Phromium ithole izincomo ezithile zokuphepha zokubuyekeza kwakho</translation>
<translation id="4657908558997566735">Amanye Amaphrofayela e-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="6097378010983112326">IChromiumOS ayikwazanga ukulondoloza idatha yeChromium kuGoogle Account yakho ngoba imininingwane yakho yokungena ngemvume ku-akhawunti iphelelwe yisikhathi</translation>
<translation id="385020720581757591">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikeza umlawuli wayo ukulawula okungaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-Phromium. Idatha yakho ye-Phromium, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshezelwa unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-Ideshibhodi yama-Akhawunti we-Google, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="5368118228313795342">Ikhodi eyengeziwe: <ph name="EXTRA_CODE" />.</translation>
<translation id="3729704134418183937">Ukuze uthole ukwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye, okufaka i-Phromium Kumsebenzi Wewebhu nowe-App</translation>
<translation id="2756028035855809142">Vula usesho ngeChromium</translation>
<translation id="4375021373215585423">Funda ukuthi kungani i-Phromium ivimba amanye amafayela</translation>
<translation id="4688227912949761884">Ibuyekeza i-Phromium (<ph name="PROGRESS_PERCENT" />)</translation>
<translation id="1581580071694756035">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengenile ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuChromium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzophinde uthole izandiso zakho nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho.</translation>
<translation id="4945147853702701048">Vumela ukungena ngemvume kwe-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="7813879193794658604">Susa kusuka  ku-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="2908302339618007937">Yehlisa indlela yokusebenza kodwa kwenza iChromium imelane nakakhulu nokuhlaselwa</translation>
<translation id="8760365573983490520">Setha i-Phromium njengesiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="6395910175148753946"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Phromium Beta</translation>
<translation id="3685567744344529931">{NUM_TABS,plural, =1{IChromium Incoma Ukumisa Ithebhu Enciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}one{IChromium Incoma Ukumisa Amathebhu Anciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}other{IChromium Incoma Ukumisa Amathebhu Anciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}}</translation>
<translation id="975923236500175446">I-Phromium kungenzeka ingasebenzi ngokufanelekile ngoba ayisasekelwa kule sistimu yokusatshalaliswa kwe-Linux</translation>
<translation id="7595270580374414215">I-Phromium ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela lingalimaza ama-akhawunti wakho omuntu siqu nawenethiwekhi yokuxhumana nomphakathi</translation>
<translation id="5644162187312430027">Sicela ulinde ngenkathi i-Phromium ifaka izibuyekezo zesistimu zakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="2476033563817685908">I-Phromium izama ukuhlela amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="1626952238284562558">Sebenza ngaphandle kokuphazamiseka ngama-app akho ayintandokazi njengeGoogle Drive neYouTube usendleleni ngeChromium.</translation>
