<translation id="446228390478495078">Thola ukufinyelela okulula ezakhini ozaziyo, ozithandayo, futhi ozethembayo ngokusetha iChromium njengebhrawuza yakho evuleka ngokuzenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="2203435422524224690">Isinqamuleli se-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="3977517784144885449">I-Phromium ivimbele lokhu kudawunilodwa ngoba ifayela alivamile ukudawunilodwa futhi lingase libe yingozi</translation>
