<translation id="6616579671682178785">Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Phromium uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
