<translation id="1744625657438211994">&amp;Lawula amaphrofayela eChromium</translation>
<translation id="7264818828956697552">Lesi senzo sizokwenza lokhu:
          <ph name="LINE_BREAKS" />
            • Setha kabusha ikhasi lakho lokuqalisa, ikhasi lethebhu entsha, injini yokusesha namathebhu aphiniwe
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Vala izandiso
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Sula amakhukhi nenye idatha yesikhashana yesayithi
            <ph name="LINE_BREAK" />
            • Setha kabusha izinqamuleli zeChromium
            <ph name="LINE_BREAKS" />
            Amabhukhimakhi, umlando, namaphasiwedi alondoloziwe ngeke aze athinteke.</translation>
<translation id="6489000842445481390">Ufinyelele umkhawulo weChromium wamabhukhimakhi angu-<ph name="BOOKMARK_LIMIT" />, ngakho amanye amabhukhimakhi akho awakalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho okwamanje.

Amabhukhimakhi amasha awakwazi ukulondolozwa e-akhawuntini yakho uze usule amanye. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, amabhukhimakhi angalondoloziwe azosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="2645108248038996858">Vula isixhumanisi kuwindi le-Phromium inco&amp;gnito</translation>
<translation id="6965382102122355670">KULUNGILE</translation>
<translation id="6985329841647292029">Imigomo ye-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="2947519843530032104">Bhala umushwana wokungena ozowusebenzisa futhi ulondoloze idatha yeChromium ku-akhawunti yakho, <ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="7011190694940573312">Ukufakwa kwehlulekile ngenxa yokuthi lolu hlobo lwesistimu yokusebenza alusekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="7024536598735240744">Iphutha lokuvula: <ph name="UNPACK_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="2267652056049724321">Yenza i-Phromium Ibe Ngeyakho</translation>
<translation id="7047386856539490735">Ingabe ibe wusizo le miphumela?</translation>
<translation id="2448910402556368916">Buyekeza i-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="7834049737623892628">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-Phromium izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google.</translation>
<translation id="1803168627715642217">Thola amandla e-AI uma usebenzisa i-app yeChromium ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho</translation>
<translation id="3321731353906178474">Thatha amaphasiwedi akho, amathebhu nokuningi usendleleni nge-app yeChromium efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="7141270731789036260">Yenza i-Chrome ibe ngokwezifiso ukuze ihlolwe</translation>
<translation id="8077731669779275332">Ungasebenzisa iChromium noma nini lapho uchofoza amalinki emiyalezweni, amadokhumenti, namanye ama-app</translation>
<translation id="611798798247797100">Susa <ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" /> kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="7962394294883785044">Inhlangano yakho isula idatha ye-Phromium uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
<translation id="2611686760870033712">I-Phromium idinga imvume yekhamera kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="71050417052775020">Ayikwazanga ukuqalisa i-Phromium. Zama futhi.</translation>
<translation id="4817060241763895497">Buza noma yini, lapho ukhona, ngeGemini kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="869358700049263961">Gcina iChromium Edokhini yakho ukuze ufike kuyo ngokushesha noma nini</translation>
<translation id="7094488679340739251">Sebenzisa i-Phromium noma nini lapho uchofoza amalinki emiyalezweni, kumadokhumenti, nakwamanye ama-app</translation>
<translation id="7216228761061470870">Uma usebenzisa Usesho Lomfanekiso kudeskithophu, isihloko sekhasi, i-URL, nekhontenti, okuhlanganisa ama-PDF, kuthunyelwa kuseva</translation>
<translation id="7802634650401946711">Isiphathi somsebenzi - I-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="5182547787327636348">Buza mayelana nekhontenti ngaphandle kweChromium, njengamanye ama-app noma amafayela</translation>
<translation id="1673408954678067905">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usevele ungene ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuChromium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzothola nemininingwane yakho elondoloziwe nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho.</translation>
<translation id="5761733252154904648">Qala ukubhrawuza ngokushesha: IChromium manje ingaqala lapho iWindows iqala.</translation>
<translation id="7274695763216404502">Kuphiniwe! Sebenzisa Usesho Lomfanekiso futhi kubha yamathuluzi</translation>
<translation id="7288567540154601580">Amathebhu nezandiso</translation>
<translation id="5616812573273137616">{NUM_EXTENSIONS,plural, =1{I-Phromium incoma ukuthi usisuse}one{I-Phromium incoma ukuthi uzisuse}other{I-Phromium incoma ukuthi uzisuse}}</translation>
<translation id="1408728332407453335">Ukuze wabelane ngomsindo wohlelo, vula Amasethingi Ohlelo bese uvumela okuthi 'Ukurekhodwa Komsindo Wohlelo Kuphela' kuChromium. Ngemva kwalokho kuzodingeka uqale kabusha iChromium.</translation>
<translation id="7299899569525778554">Sesha kudeskithophu</translation>
<translation id="6194310460545162015">Ibuyekeza i-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="1098154893096691883">Ifayela lakho lokuncamelayo limoshakele noma alivumelekile.

I-Phromium ayikwazi ukubuyisela izilungiselelo zakho.</translation>
<translation id="7324051657739063017">Ungavula kabusha Imisebenzi Engokomongo ukuze ubuze imibuzo ngesikhathi ubhrawuza</translation>
<translation id="7024097830259741656">Iwebhu yakho, amabhukhimakhi, nezinye izinto ze-Phromium zihlala lapha.</translation>
<translation id="852511575759652041">Ngumuntu onomushwana wakho wokungena kuphela ongafunda idatha yakho ebetheliwe. Umshwana wokungena awuthunyelwa noma ulondolozwe yiGoogle. Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />susa idatha yeChromium ku-akhawunti yakho<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="2846900085504364505">Umlawuli wakho wesistimu ulungiselele i-Phromium ukuthi ivule i-<ph name="ALTERNATIVE_BROWSER_NAME" /> ukuze ifinyelele ku-<ph name="TARGET_URL_HOSTNAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="7352651011704765696">Okuthile akuhambanga kahle</translation>
<translation id="7198690862684855451">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo ezizayo zeChromium, uzodinga imacOS 13 noma eyakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa imacOS 12.</translation>
<translation id="3224607549103501149">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IChromium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" /></translation>
<translation id="73786666777299047">Vula isitolo sewebhu se-Chrome</translation>
<translation id="8446269872172461565">Bonisa iGemini kuChromium kugqoko lwesistimu</translation>
<translation id="7401687852903179959">Sesha Le Vidiyo Ngosesho Lwesithombe</translation>
<translation id="3403529853122418035">IChromium manje isiyibhrawuza evuleka ngokuzenzekela yakho</translation>
<translation id="5649377421626481711">Qhubeka lapho ogcine khona: IChromium ingabuyisela amathebhu akho njalo lapho uqala kabusha Ukuze ukuvale lokhu, iya ku-</translation>
<translation id="2467776530444676191">Ngenisa Amaphasiwedi KuChromium</translation>
<translation id="8814480293815136510">1. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_LABEL" /> ngezansi
2. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_2" /> kumasethingi akho eWindows
3. Chofoza okuthi <ph name="BUTTON_3" /> esazisweni seWindows ukuze uphine iChromium kutaskbar yakho ukuze ufinyelele ngokushesha</translation>
<translation id="4458219452141227397"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Phromium Dev</translation>
<translation id="7450541714075000668">Umbhalo okopishiwe</translation>
<translation id="6826407056979820031">Ukuze usebenzise imakrofoni yakho, nikeza iChromium ukufinyelela <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />amasethingi ohlelo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="1392131731909663319">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Phromium, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 7.</translation>
<translation id="4512427777724578739">Qalisa kabusha i-Phromium?</translation>
<translation id="4510527847350985067">Ayikwazi ukufaka inguqulo ye-Phromium efana nale esebenzayo okwamanje. Sicela uvale i-Phromium uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7510190804000607802">Isikhumbuzi: Okungcono kakhulu kweGoogle ephaketheni lakho</translation>
<translation id="4735608937705010375">Amasayithi cishe azosebenza njengokulindelwe. Uzophuma ngemvume kumasayithi amaningi uma uvala wonke amawindi e-Phromium, ngaphandle kwe-Google Account yakho uma ungene ngemvume ku-Phromium.</translation>
<translation id="7987051132742764178">{0,plural, =1{I-Phromium izoqalisa kabusha kuminithi elingu-1}one{I-Phromium izoqalisa kabusha emaminithini angu-#}other{I-Phromium izoqalisa kabusha emaminithini angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="1904271152425995672">Ukuvikela idatha lakho vumela iChromium isuse izimvume emasayithini ongakawavakasheli muva nje.</translation>
<translation id="7909976731673595773">Qalisa iChromium ngokuzenzekelayo ukuze uqale ukubhrawuza ngokushesha.</translation>
<translation id="7583399374488819119">Isifaki Se-<ph name="COMPANY_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="3301232962183130807">I-Phromium isebenzisa ikhamela yakho nemakrofoni.</translation>
<translation id="3230129417775002227">I-Phromium ibe ngcono nakakhulu</translation>
<translation id="1322165820810533683">Manje unezakhi eziningi ezitholakala kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="7624307931717240213">Sisebenzisa ulwazi ukuthuthukisa le sevisi. Bheka Inqubomgomo Yobumfihlo kanye Nemigomo Yesevisi.</translation>
<translation id="7649070708921625228">Usizo</translation>
<translation id="3795437289339745990">Thola i-App yeChromium</translation>
<translation id="7658239707568436148">Khansela</translation>
<translation id="6671257169702988694">I-Phromium akusona isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="7270402397025248165">Vumelanisa uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-Phromium kumadivayisi akho wonkana</translation>
<translation id="6267574654655324634">Isibuyekezo se-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="4868190765388740513">Umsebenzi wakho uvikelekile kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="7716950018788545737">Imisebenzi iqediwe.</translation>
<translation id="77283119132245232">Inikeza amasevisi okulandelela isistimu ku-<ph name="BROWSER_NAME" />. Uma le sevisi ikhutshaziwe, ukusebenza kokulandelela okusungulwe yibhrawuza ngeke kuhlanganise imisebenzi yobubanzi besistimu njengokushintshwa kokuqukethwe kanye nemisebenzi esikulungele yochungechunge.</translation>
<translation id="2680098142787722612">Lokhu kuzosusa idatha yakho yokuphequlula kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Phromium njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="7747138024166251722">Isifaki asikwazanga ukudala umkhombandlela wesikhashana. Sicela uhlolele isikhala esikhululekile sediski nemvume ukuze ufake isofthiwe.</translation>
<translation id="6830826880333833598">Setha Kabusha kuChromium Ezenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="448710321315554838">Ukuze uvikele umsebenzi wakho kuChromium, inhlangano yakho izokwazi ukubuka noma ukulawula ulwazi oluthile uma ungene ngemvume kuChromium.</translation>
<translation id="7045209483723342691">Setha iChromium njengokuzenzakalelayo bese uyiphina ku-taskbar</translation>
<translation id="6452735947982563207">Yenza i-Phromium isheshe</translation>
<translation id="2826377606185230093"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Phromium Canary</translation>
<translation id="6929858452581400763">Kwenze kube nzima kubantu abanokufinyelela kuthrafikhi yakho ye-inthanethi ukuze babone ukuthi imaphi amasayithi owavakashelayo. I-Phromium isebenzisa ukuxhuma okuvikelekile ukuze ibheke ikheli lasesizindeni se-inthanethi lesayithi ku-DNS (Isistimu Yokwetha Isizinda).</translation>
<translation id="7810005234485217901">Ungaphina Usesho Lomfanekiso ukuze lufinyeleleke kalula</translation>
<translation id="4343392731007327660">Khetha ukuthi yini ongabelana ngayo neChromium</translation>
<translation id="3052274192923256457">Iphrofayela ye-Phromium enale akhawunti isikhona akakade kule divayisi</translation>
<translation id="7845233973568007926">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqalise kabusha ikhompyutha yakho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="5674414381037997114">Injini yakho yokusesha ishintshwe ngaphandle kweChromium. Ukuze ikuvikele, iChromium iyisetha kabusha ibuyele kokuzenzakalelayo kwayo kwasekuqaleni. <ph name="LEARN_MORE_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="2382629958428086738">Yenza iChromium ngokwesifiso sakho ukuze uyinikeze ukubukeka okusha</translation>
<translation id="3966946337517395351">Uma uthayipha ibha yekheli noma ibhokisi losesho, i-Phromium ithumela lokho okuthayiphayo kunjini yakho yosesho yokuzenzakalelayo ukuze uthole iziphakamiso ezingcono. Lokhu kuvaliwe ku-Incognito.</translation>
<translation id="3928367799779122681">I-Phromium ayikwazanga ukubuyekezela kwinguqulo yakamuva, ngakho-ke uyalahlekelwa kuzici ezintsha nokulungiswa kokuphepha.</translation>
<translation id="7872446069773932638">Iyadawuniloda... kusele imizuzwana engu-<ph name="SECONDS" /></translation>
<translation id="8492102592995742850">Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi, <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />sula idatha yeChromium ku-akhawunti yakho<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="959404544431817539">Vula ngokushesha iGemini kuChromium noma nini lapho uyidinga</translation>
<translation id="8889749279816358185">Setha i-Phromium njengokwakho okuzenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="3173775358556080672">IChromium ithuthukisa ukuxhuma okungavikelekile ku-HTTPS ngokuzenzekelayo lapho kungenzeka</translation>
<translation id="2210801904933897209">Ubukade ungene ngemvume ku-Phromium njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />. Sicela usebenzise i-akhawunti efanayo ukuze uphinde ungene ngemvume futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7291855477503010638">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usevele ungene ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuChromium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzothola namabhukhimakhi wakho nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho.</translation>
<translation id="5706099517903615644">Lokhu ukufakwa kwesibili kwe-Phromium, futhi akukwazi ukwenziwa isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="2388440031754359882">Izandiso, ama-app, namatimu asuka emithonjeni engaziwa angalimaza idivayisi yakho. I-Phromium incoma ukuzifaka kuphela zisuka ku-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /></translation>
<translation id="8205108509545565485">Thola okungcono kakhulu kweGoogle nge-app yeChromium efonini yakho <ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /></translation>
<translation id="8004582292198964060">Isiphequluli</translation>
<translation id="8010081455002666927">Thola ngokuzenzakalela</translation>
<translation id="6421861275173778152">Uma i-Phromium inokufinyelela, amawebhusayithi azokwazi ukukucela ukufinyelela.</translation>
<translation id="942087293138739513">Phina iChromium ku-taskbar yakho ukuze ufike kuyo ngokushesha noma nini</translation>
<translation id="80471789339884597">Siyabonga ngokufaka. Kufanele uqalise kabusha wonke amabhrawuza akho ngaphambi kokusebenzisa i-<ph name="BUNDLE_NAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="8054112667659782652">Bonisa Isinqamuleli Sokusesha Umfanekiso Njalo</translation>
<translation id="8069447462453318634">Khetha okuthi "Phina kubha yamathuluzi"</translation>
<translation id="8519423983825025511">Vala iChromium esebenza ngemuva kuma-app</translation>
<translation id="80790299200510644">Ukusesha Umfanekiso</translation>
<translation id="8086881907087796310">Ukufakwa kwehlulekile ngenxa yokuthi ikhompyutha yakho ayihlangabezani nezimfuneko zenani elincane lehadiwe.</translation>
<translation id="8096472344908884505"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - I-Google Chrome Yokuhlola</translation>
<translation id="7988414336652558428">I-Phromium idinga imvume yendawo kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="1778610353097215460">Ngokuzayo uma uvula iChromium ku-<ph name="DEVICE_TYPE" /> yakho, uzobona umyalelo wokusebenzisa izexwayiso zokulandelela intengo.</translation>
<translation id="4182143801062869250">Thola izexwayiso zokwehla kwentengo ezintweni onentshisekelo kuzo nge-app yeChromium efonini yakho</translation>
<translation id="8118331347066725040">Thumela impendulo yokusesha nge-Lens</translation>
<translation id="849080025203861031">Yenza iChromium ibe ngeyakho</translation>
<translation id="8133124826068723441">I-ChromiumOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba Ukuvumelanisa akutholakali kusizinda sakho.</translation>
<translation id="813913629614996137">Iyaqalisa...</translation>
<translation id="139377652856781272">Vula iGemini kuChromium ngesinqamuleli sekhibhodi.</translation>
<translation id="8577594891153686998">Imigomo Yesevisi Eyengeziwe yeChromium</translation>
<translation id="6418547610462348357">Leli fayela liyingozi, ngakho-ke i-Phromium iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="8177472873527554730">Asikwazi ukuthola ikhontenti kuleli khasi</translation>
<translation id="6257816439683677727">Bhala umushwana wokungena ozowusebenzisa futhi ulondoloze idatha yeChromium e-akhawuntini yakho, <ph name="USER_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="820759916613250543">Sesha Lesi sithombe Ngosesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
<translation id="8221491193165283816">Uvamise ukuvimba izaziso. Ukuze uvumele leli sayithi ukuthi likwazise, chofoza lapha.</translation>
<translation id="8672013454464753607">Ukuze usebenzise ikhamera yakho, nikeza iChromium ukufinyelela <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />amasethingi ohlelo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="8006746139865532235">I-Phromium ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivelaphi, futhi kungenzeka ukuthi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-Phromium ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="5474258904581730105">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-Phromium izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google. Ungavala lokhu kuzilungiselelo noma kunini.</translation>
<translation id="5375524124600974413">Ngena ngemvume ku-Phromium kuphrofayela entsha?</translation>
<translation id="5242991719841602450">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usevele ungene ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuChromium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzophinde uthole amaphasiwedi wakho nokuningi ku-<ph name="DEVICE" />.</translation>
<translation id="6524280192518819368">Bonisa iGemini kuChromium kugqoko lwesistimu bese uvula isinqamuleli sekhibhodi</translation>
<translation id="2082268001133511745"><ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />I-Phromium ikuxwayisa<ph name="END_LINK" /> mayelana namasayithi angaphephile kanye nokudawunilodiwe</translation>
<translation id="4030955203048827163">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IChromium isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION" />.</translation>
<translation id="8358344509940735943">Thenga, humusha futhi uhlonze okubonayo ngekhamera yakho ku-app yeChromium iOS</translation>
<translation id="7062802333437169650">Ikhodi ye-QR yokungena ngemvume kuChromium njengo-<ph name="USER_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="8313851650939857356">Iphutha ekuqaliseni: <ph name="STARTUP_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="751774429778958062">Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Phromium uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />.</translation>
<translation id="8321888067342493336">Londoloza njengesithombe</translation>
<translation id="6013358021678212671"><ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> ngaphambilini ibisebenzisa i-Phromium</translation>
<translation id="5445795756751365814">Sebenzisa Amakhono kuChromium</translation>
<translation id="7329745364783464770">Buyekeza iChromium ukuze uqhubeke usebenzisa idatha yeChromium kuGoogle Account yakho, <ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL" /></translation>
